title: metarecord:reconcile
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Reconcile]]
kind: reference
summary: Reconcile the selected metarecord's subtree (`watch`: start tracking it first)

Reconciles the selected directory's subtree ([[Scoped reconcile]]); with `watch`, sets `mf_watch = true` on it first — tracking a folder in one gesture ([[Tracking a folder]]).
